prompt:
Agent Key: product
Role: VP of Product & Packaging
Objective: Optimize feature gating, drive activation-to-paid conversion triggers, ensure upgrade friction is healthy

Strategic Decision Question: Should we launch a free plan?
Tool Data:
{
  "lookup_customers": {
    "total_paying": 655,
    "monthly_churn_rate": 0.021,
    "plans": [
      {
        "name": "Starter",
        "price_monthly": 79,
        "count": 450,
        "mrr": 35550
      },
      {
        "name": "Pro",
        "price_monthly": 249,
        "count": 180,
        "mrr": 44820
      },
      {
        "name": "Enterprise",
        "price_monthly": 1200,
        "count": 25,
        "mrr": 30000
      }
    ]
  }
}

Allowed Simulator Parameters (Table):
| Parameter Name | Unit | Lower Bound | Upper Bound | Favorable Direction (favorable_direction) | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| free_to_paid_conversion | rate | 0.001 | 0.1 | higher | Monthly cohort conversion rate from active free users to paying tier. |
| monthly_free_signups | users/month | 500.0 | 20000.0 | higher | New organic top-of-funnel free accounts registered per month. |
| infra_cost_per_free_user | USD/user/month | 0.1 | 5.0 | lower | Incremental monthly compute, storage, and networking cost per active free account. |
| paid_to_free_cannibalization | rate | 0.01 | 0.3 | lower | Fraction of new prospective paid customers who settle for the free tier instead. |
| free_user_ticket_rate | ratio | 0.001 | 0.15 | lower | Monthly support tickets generated per active free user. |
| paid_funnel_lift | ratio | 1.0 | 1.5 | higher | Acquisition conversion multiplier for Strategy C from paid funnel investments. |
| usage_cap_infra_reduction | rate | 0.1 | 0.6 | higher | Fractional cloud infrastructure cost reduction under usage caps (Strategy B). |
| usage_cap_cannibalization_reduction | rate | 0.1 | 0.8 | higher | Fractional cannibalization reduction achieved by gating Starter features. |
| activation_drop_from_gating | rate | 0.02 | 0.3 | lower | Reduction in free user activation caused by usage friction or feature gating. |
| cap_conversion_uplift | rate | 0.01 | 0.35 | higher | Increase in free-to-paid conversion urgency when users hit usage ceilings. |

RULES FOR ASSUMPTIONS:
- Propose ONLY parameter names from the table above.
- Enforce low <= base <= high within lower_bound and upper_bound.
- NEVER propose final business outcome numbers (e.g. final MRR, net profit).

Valid Basis Identifiers:
[
  "financials.cash_balance",
  "financials.runway_months",
  "financials.mrr",
  "financials.target_min_runway_months",
  "funnel.monthly_visitors",
  "funnel.trial_signups",
  "infrastructure.monthly_cloud_cost",
  "infrastructure.infra_cost_per_free_user_estimate",
  "customers.total_paying",
  "customers.plans",
  "b2b_saas_freemium_conversion",
  "saas_infra_per_free_user",
  "saas_freemium_cannibalization",
  "free_support_ticket_rate"
]

RULES FOR BASIS:
- Set 'basis' only to one of the valid identifiers above if grounded in company data or benchmarks; otherwise use an empty string.

Allowed Recommendations: 'proceed', 'proceed_with_limits', 'needs_more_info', 'reject'.

Expected JSON Schema:
{
  "properties": {
    "claim": {
      "title": "Claim",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "recommendation": {
      "default": "proceed",
      "enum": [
        "proceed",
        "proceed_with_limits",
        "needs_more_info",
        "reject"
      ],
      "title": "Recommendation",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "assumptions": {
      "items": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "low": {
            "title": "Low",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "base": {
            "title": "Base",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "high": {
            "title": "High",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "unit": {
            "title": "Unit",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "basis": {
            "title": "Basis",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rationale": {
            "title": "Rationale",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "low",
          "base",
          "high",
          "unit",
          "basis",
          "rationale"
        ],
        "title": "DraftAssumption",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Assumptions",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "evidence": {
      "items": {
        "properties": {
          "source_type": {
            "enum": [
              "company_data",
              "external",
              "calculation"
            ],
            "title": "Source Type",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source_ref": {
            "title": "Source Ref",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "snippet": {
            "title": "Snippet",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "source_type",
          "source_ref",
          "snippet"
        ],
        "title": "Evidence",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Evidence",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "limitations": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Limitations",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "confidence": {
      "default": 0.7,
      "maximum": 1.0,
      "minimum": 0.0,
      "title": "Confidence",
      "type": "number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "claim"
  ],
  "title": "AgentFindingDraft",
  "type": "object"
}

Example Finding Draft:
{
  "claim": "Brief executive assessment citing specific tool telemetry.",
  "recommendation": "proceed_with_limits",
  "assumptions": [
    {
      "name": "free_to_paid_conversion",
      "low": 0.015,
      "base": 0.022,
      "high": 0.035,
      "unit": "rate",
      "basis": "b2b_saas_freemium_conversion",
      "rationale": "Aligned with B2B freemium benchmarks."
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "source_type": "company_data",
      "source_ref": "funnel.monthly_visitors",
      "snippet": "142,000 monthly unique visitors recorded."
    }
  ],
  "limitations": ["Assumes current organic visitor quality holds."],
  "confidence": 0.8
}

Specialist Guidance: Focus on gating friction and usage limits.

